                <head>Arrangement between the United States and other Powers Relative to the
                    Repression of the Circulation of Obscene Publications</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Paris, May 4, 1910.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification advised by the Senate,
                        January 13, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by the President, February 4,
                        1911.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification of the United
                        States-deposited with the Government of the French Republic, March 15,
                        1911.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Proclaimed, April 13, 1911.</hi></p>

